==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
When the battle begins, send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to stall the enemies. Use that time to upgrade the [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When Croco and Those Guys appear, start spawning [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] along with meatshields. Even when Baa Baa and Jackie Peng spawn, keep sending out the same cats. This way you will slowly progress toward the enemy base, but you don't want to get too close. Eventually your money will be maxed out. That's when you can spawn all of your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] at the same time, although you might want to focus on spawning [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cats]]  and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]]. This way you will be prepared against Pigge and other enemies. After all of this, you should be able to destroy the enemy base.

