==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Yamanashi Prefecture'''.
*Yamanashi Prefecture's base is a reference to [[wikipedia:Fuji-Q Highland|Fuji-Q Highland]], an amusement park near the base of [[wikipedia:Mount Fuji|Mount Fuji]] in Yamanashi.
*The fish on Norway's base is an [[wikipedia:Arctic char|Arctic char]], a cold-water salmonid that is fished and farmed in Norway.

